# Frame Tweaks' official packs: their folders in packs/, one per line, in the order they're loaded
# and listed (the installer window, ./install.sh list, README.md, docs/tweaks.md, SECURITY.md).
# The one list of them: lib/registry.py (OFFICIAL_PACKS), lib/common.sh (official_packs), and
# install.sh and dev/ through those or by reading this file. A pack left out here would be taken
# for a user's local pack: asked to be trusted, its texts not translated, its docs not checked.
# A new one also needs its folder un-ignored in .gitignore, which publishes only these.
core
integrations
third-party
bugfixes
